<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman ups SmithKline growth.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman ups SmithKline growth.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Wednesday it raised its estimate for earnings per share growth at pharmaceutical group SmithKline Beecham Plc.</p>
<p>Following a meeting with SmithKline chief executive Jan Leschly, Lehman analyst Stewart Adkins said he raised his annual EPS growth estimate through the year 2000 to 14 percent from 11 percent.</p>
</text>
